WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.360
Far away in a distant galaxy, the people of the planet Prismos enjoyed a life of ease and comfort.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.260
But this was not to last, for the realignment of the three blazing suns

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.440
signaled the end of the age of technology.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.990
Scientists are at a loss to explain the disruption of technology across the planet,

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.890
but authorities warn against panic.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.310
And the beginning of a new age of magic.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:28.010
As the old order collapsed, the good kingdoms formed a confederacy led by Leoric.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.670
Feral! Ektar!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.560
To arms!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:34.220
While the evil kingdoms fell under the brutal hand of Darkstorm.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.650
It was then that a mysterious wizard named Merklin

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.490
told the knights of a great shrine filled with magic.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.790
Magic of every description.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.040
The bravest among them set out to test their skills,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.380
but only a few survived the ordeal and became visionaries.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Congratulations, noble knights.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.540
You have survived the final test.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.480
You are the visionary.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:05.790
They were vested with animal totems and power staffs, which gave them strange and amazing abilities.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.550
But not even magic would bring peace to this war-torn world.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:16.220
The young woman is the evil knight, Viroline.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:28.880
Is fading. Will that be all?

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:29.690
Yes.

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:31.210
will be

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.320
Take that.

