00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:16.760
not have been relegated to this degrading labor but ricard any work is exalted as long as it is done

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:22.280
in the name of the great dark storm were you born to be a bootlegger or did you pick up the trade

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:28.290
in your early manhood to insult dark storm's minister of loyalty is to insult the exalted one

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:29.930
dark storm must have

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.390
honor put away your weapon and do not embarrass yourself no you must pay the

